            <trans-unit id="decorative.warning.section" resname="decorative.warning.section">
                <source>Decorative images get no alt text. Screen readers then skip them. That only fits if the image adds nothing to the content. This image belongs to the section “%s” and therefore probably needs an alt text. Mark it as decorative anyway?</source>
                <target>Dekorative Bilder bekommen keinen Alt-Text. Screenreader überspringen sie dann. Das passt nur, wenn das Bild nichts zum Inhalt beiträgt. Dieses Bild gehört zum Abschnitt „%s“ und braucht deshalb wahrscheinlich einen Alt-Text. Trotzdem als dekorativ markieren?</target>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="decorative.warning.record" resname="decorative.warning.record">
                <source>Decorative images get no alt text. Screen readers then skip them. That only fits if the image adds nothing to the content. This image belongs to the %1$s “%2$s” and therefore probably needs an alt text. Mark it as decorative anyway?</source>
